811
01:14:01,632 --> 01:14:02,759
Sinto muito.

812
01:14:04,369 --> 01:14:05,462
Está bem.

813
01:14:15,279 --> 01:14:16,440
Certo.

814
01:14:24,255 --> 01:14:25,245
